	(text_box "OCVPB21-13F6 combines a polarity bridge, ESD clamps, overvoltage cut-off and a current limit. Input range 4.25 to 5.55 V. OUT_5V needs 10 uF or more (C24)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 172.72 35.56 0) (size 88 6.2) (margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525) (stroke (width 0.1524) (type solid) (color 200 0 0 1)) (fill (type color) (color 160 195 245 1)) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "feac15e0-5705-4ecb-85d0-cee50446acc1"))
	(text_box "RLIM (R14) sets the current limit: ILIM = (318 - RLIM) / 0.447 mA. 180 Ohm gives about 310 mA." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 172.72 44.76 0) (size 88 6.2) (margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525) (stroke (width 0.1524) (type solid) (color 200 0 0 1)) (fill (type color) (color 160 195 245 1)) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "f0cac4dc-983d-4e46-af9c-ccae7b0c4e53"))
	(text_box "FLAG is open drain. R15 pulls it up to 1.8 V, so the processor reads a low level when a fault is reported (CHG_FLAG)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 172.72 53.96 0) (size 88 6.2) (margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525) (stroke (width 0.1524) (type solid) (color 200 0 0 1)) (fill (type color) (color 160 195 245 1)) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "aec6eeef-35ff-4ba9-8902-e6257606f70a"))
	(text_box "Operating temperature of this part is -30 to +65 degC. Keep that in mind for the charging case. The data pins are not used with two pogo pads, so they are left open (crosses). C24 is 10 uF 10 V X5R: its effective value at 5 V is lower, so pick a part that still gives 10 uF or more at 5 V (for example 22 uF)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 172.72 63.16 0) (size 88 10.2) (margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525) (stroke (width 0.1524) (type solid) (color 200 0 0 1)) (fill (type color) (color 160 195 245 1)) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "699daaf8-ff30-411f-8930-b42231f35c45"))
